tml","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Serialize to bytes via <code>torch.save</code> (carries tensors in <code>data</code>).</p>\n<p>Pickle protocol 4: <code>torch.save</code>'s default protocol 2 has no bytes\nopcode and writes a <code>bytes</code> value in <code>data</code> through a latin-1\n<code>str</code>, 1.5x the size and several times slower to save and load.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h4 id=\"nnsight.schema.response.ResponseModel.unpickle\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-method\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">unpickle</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-classmethod\"><code>classmethod</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h4>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"unpickle(data: bytes) -> ResponseModel"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Rebuild a <a title=\"            ResponseModel\" href=\"#nnsight.schema.response.ResponseModel\"><code>ResponseModel</code></a> from <a title=\"            pickle\" href=\"#nnsight.schema.response.ResponseModel.pickle\"><code>pickle</code></a> bytes (onto CPU).</p>\n\n\n    </div>"}]}